      "is_free": false,
      "detailed_description": "<i>Detective Loup is thrilled when his children, Sherry and Bo, express interest in his profession. To teach by playing, he assembles a series of miniature crime scenes. Every night, the family gathers around to solve the most puzzling cases in history from the comfort of their own home.</i><br><br>Little Locked Rooms is a short and unique <strong>mystery game</strong> that challenges you to solve a series of impossible disappearances and murders.<br><br>Investigate tiny models of the crime scenes and read witness testimonies. The criminals used <strong>clever tricks</strong> to obscure what really happened. Use your deductive skills to see through the lies and uncover the truth!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Carefully crafted mystery puzzles of ranging difficulty.<br></li><li>Playtime between 2 and 3 hours, depending on playstyle.<br></li><li>Little animations play out in the dioramas to bring explanations and ideas to life!<br></li><li>Hint system to lend you a hand if you get stuck!</li></ul>",
      "about_the_game": "<i>Detective Loup is thrilled when his children, Sherry and Bo, express interest in his profession. To teach by playing, he assembles a series of miniature crime scenes. Every night, the family gathers around to solve the most puzzling cases in history from the comfort of their own home.</i><br><br>Little Locked Rooms is a short and unique <strong>mystery game</strong> that challenges you to solve a series of impossible disappearances and murders.<br><br>Investigate tiny models of the crime scenes and read witness testimonies. The criminals used <strong>clever tricks</strong> to obscure what really happened. Use your deductive skills to see through the lies and uncover the truth!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Carefully crafted mystery puzzles of ranging difficulty.<br></li><li>Playtime between 2 and 3 hours, depending on playstyle.<br></li><li>Little animations play out in the dioramas to bring explanations and ideas to life!<br></li><li>Hint system to lend you a hand if you get stuck!</li></ul>",
      "short_description": "Grab your magnifying glass and peek inside a series of tiny dioramas filled with crimes and carefully crafted mysteries! Think outside the box and solve them all in this new brand of detective game!",
